{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is in the demo? </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Cozyrama Demo</u> features sandbox mode, giving you everything you need to create a beautiful diorama. It\u2019s a perfect little taste of what\u2019s to come while you wait for the full version! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of items to choose from,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraforming tools (paths, grass, water),</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many colors to set up the mood for your diorama,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995370/extras/b3c78b1a2b8d2eb0b63c8a0dd09b8f11.poster.avif?t=1757277163\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995370/extras/b3c78b1a2b8d2eb0b63c8a0dd09b8f11.webm?t=1757277163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cozyrama, you can create the perfect world just the way you imagine. Start from its shape, then pick the right color and have fun with decorations. Would you like to build a cozy village or a colorful garden? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995370/extras/0a42618b7adef18fb8ff0a32cd9065ba.poster.avif?t=1757277163\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995370/extras/0a42618b7adef18fb8ff0a32cd9065ba.webm?t=1757277163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no time limit and no competition. Immerse yourself in a beautiful and imaginative world that feels like a warm hug. Watch cute animals wandering around, and pet them if you like. Whether for a few minutes or a few hours, it's a place where you can unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995370/extras/99e2c45e926bfda126b772de264eb66b.poster.avif?t=1757277163\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995370/extras/99e2c45e926bfda126b772de264eb66b.webm?t=1757277163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also design and decorate the world inside the picture. Add charming decorations such as lanterns, benches, and little animal friends, to bring the surroundings to life. Whether you prefer a bright and lively space or a quiet, starlit night, this world is yours to shape. Create your peaceful oasis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995370/extras/7747987aed63ce88e07716cb850ee3df.avif?t=1757277163\" data-has-big width=1560 height=4580 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995370?t=1757277163","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995370?t=1757277163","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995370/99d9c298830291d40f96a5f5edc44cfa784ef9d6/capsule_2